3. ARCHITECTURE
============================================================

Create separate processing layers.

LAYER 1: FILE DISCOVERY

Responsibilities:

1. Identify all uploaded Excel files.
2. Classify each file as:
   a. Asset/Trial Balance submission
   b. Liability submission
   c. Off-balance-sheet submission
   d. Account mapping
3. Detect workbook sheet names.
4. Confirm that one and only one Trial Balance sheet is available.
5. Detect duplicate or conflicting workbooks.
6. Record input filenames, sheet names, file size, and workbook metadata in the Run Controls output.

Do not classify a workbook only by filename. Use both filename and workbook contents.

LAYER 2: TRIAL BALANCE EXTRACTION

Read only the sheet named:

Trial Balance

The engine must support multiple Trial Balance layouts.

Preferred layout:

Account
Account Desc
