LAYER 7: BS MAPPING AGGREGATION

Aggregate the Trial Balance as follows:

Level 1:
BS Mapping + Account + Account Description + Transaction Currency

Level 2:
BS Mapping + Transaction Currency

Level 3:
BS Mapping Grand Total

